/Alt (Timeline of the release of different Phi model collections. In April 2024, Phi 3 models were launched, enabling powerful small language models \(SLMs\) in resource-constrained environments. In August 2024, Phi 3.5 models were introduced as advanced versions of Phi 3, optimized for multilingual and long-context tasks. Between December 2024 and January 2025, Phi 4 models were released, supporting function calling and reasoning across vision, speech, audio and text through Phi-4-multimodal-instruct. ␀)
